  cleared while it ran". Final: every list rulesFormat nil, In List and
  Active "—", "Not loaded", no file in ContentRuleLists, refreshing empty.
  It also showed the gap fixed next: easylist-cookie and urlhaus-filter,
  whose parse had not started, found their text deleted and downloaded
